#: scenario5:scenario5_75C07A29_C01E_4B8A_89D6_B8CBC2D40686
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edbb8258e6c6de3c055c83cd6e22f63a96f1f3d398f3dfdfb84e04e6610aec96
#. default-sha256: 3d8628c45c9b9b86ac246f8c1e6e70ead3d16c78ef8b46ed11661d75fa6a89d3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_75C07A29_C01E_4B8A_89D6_B8CBC2D40686"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Giselle didn’t recover for some time "
"after I managed to get her inside. ⟪k:11⟫Unsure what else I could do for her,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫지젤은 그 후로도 ⟪k:12⟫망연자실한 상"
"태였다.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫나는 우는 지젤을 어쩌면 좋을지 몰라서――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5E3A5592_8060_41EB_BC69_E08FE5260F40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a15cf8c8ccbd64466ec3e1f8cc8caf49b3b606f37fa2ad5b5de3fca9405ed0e
#. default-sha256: d837dfacf9d948f1e62842e88538fcfc6cc567c63f45b4c8be89ecb5d5e4b9a2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5E3A5592_8060_41EB_BC69_E08FE5260F40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had her sit before the fireplace and waited in silence as she sobbed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫난로 앞에다 앉힌 후에 ⟪k:1⟫아무 말도 ⟪k:2⟫못 하고 있었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C5F59D36_BBD5_4935_BED2_38B5B1977943
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83b706f23e3875c4643e1d20fbcc578350945063b282e205cc9d3cb501b15602
#. default-sha256: a848d778bd0c24dbc24983943c24ccb666fa6b3656d59c8f574d8e69fb867d93
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C5F59D36_BBD5_4935_BED2_38B5B1977943"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had no idea what one was supposed to say to someone who was crying."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫우는 인간에게 ⟪k:1⟫무슨 말을 하면 좋을지 ⟪k:2⟫알 턱이 없다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_133846E6_A6C0_4A08_9035_F8D79CDAA20A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b06c1d685d3eb5712660ef3d354b61812ae8c496e6a586ba5262cbdba30cc3e
#. default-sha256: 1afe2df9e38b81986ec99ebbcc55f4e2eeb4286f5132492ca3bbf343296e14b8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_133846E6_A6C0_4A08_9035_F8D79CDAA20A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Was it normal to offer them a warm drink? ⟪k:1⟫I didn’t know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫보통 같으면 ⟪k:1⟫따뜻한 음료라도 내어 주는 걸까…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫나는 ⟪k:4⟫보통이 뭔지 모르겠다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A50EF3F8_025D_4A44_B855_E041CE1DBF29
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02eb9f6cae9004646ab4652ce6e1705d782167cb83847fa6b33672f7f5a72902
#. default-sha256: dc1494e4c213e6d5cdcc66103e4b10d76fc88600cc7b7ae79f37616e09b0937a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A50EF3F8_025D_4A44_B855_E041CE1DBF29"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I ⟪k:1⟫did⟪k:2⟫ know I needed to reflect on the things she had said outside and try to make "
"sense of them,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래서 ⟪k:1⟫내가 가능한 거라곤――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫지젤이 외친 말을 되새겨 ⟪k:4⟫이해를 시도하는 것뿐이"
"었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_41884D0C_E62C_4552_9297_0CB1123236FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 063ef13afe9165686c682253aa3b4d1eca0d59bcc9cb5276b77b6ff7dfed7b8c
#. default-sha256: a3cefa54b9e5a1a00e1a4296f21380707926bef5a4512a14788e2b3f896449a9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_41884D0C_E62C_4552_9297_0CB1123236FF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and from there, calm myself down and prepare for the conversation we were to have—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"as unpleasant as I was sure it would be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫불길한 예감에 오한을 느끼면서도, ⟪k:2⟫지젤과 대화할 것에 대비하여…… 혼란을 가라앉"
"혔다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F7385662_6EF7_4B14_BBFC_FE0FF5D9D8FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86ecb8d494c8fbaa6ff2c801e4a84039095a5cdfb4c17360f84fc6ee919b978a
#. default-sha256: db901a1723f58d6a0d2941f32ab047651719d4e5537ad78fdab6b7cbcd916f62
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F7385662_6EF7_4B14_BBFC_FE0FF5D9D8FB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...A considerable amount of time later, Giselle’s sobbing drew to a stop, an oppressive "
"silence stepping in to take its place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……그러다 시간이 지나니, ⟪k:1⟫지젤이 울음을 그쳐서―― ⟪k:2⟫침묵이 공간을 새로이 장악했다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_33894D3D_9BB8_4C3F_846B_652972ED72BA
