#: scenario5:scenario5_A1A925CB_1079_4097_9984_F74FFA5128D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a984c8903c9f01462057b0a7c979de2654cf783164387fb99a7215cfbddd301
#. default-sha256: a072723bbbb8d9bee0c59bec8c49109ee9b729fda85174fdec88c00e59891578
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A1A925CB_1079_4097_9984_F74FFA5128D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For far longer than was comfortable, the only sound we heard was the gentle crackling of the "
"fire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫우리의 긴 침묵 속, ⟪k:1⟫들리는 거라곤 타다닥거리는 ⟪k:2⟫작은 난롯불 소리."

#: scenario5:scenario5_2FC207D4_5BB8_4F13_8ED3_B5CC837D3D60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36caaf0f9c8e5a2a3fa0a4af99857cb66bfd6c9ba016c5ad96c9dab3932f9190
#. default-sha256: bc2e4a6e53806adf0198d01a8da47f838bc89209212b9bf808f276d9c74935f4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2FC207D4_5BB8_4F13_8ED3_B5CC837D3D60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had to say something.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I knew that, but what I didn’t know was how to begin."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……입을 열어야 하는 건 나다. ⟪k:1⟫하지만 무슨 말부터 꺼내야 할지, ⟪k:2⟫뭘 물어봐야 할지 짐작"
"도 안 되었다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_7636C76B_F264_44A8_B5FB_DAF40CA9AC9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d4f293669c1d340007567c60861370fafe0ed2592a6229ddd515e7f240ee241
#. default-sha256: 2c5325ce98695173c78f8d675db6c1de8ddf11eff6e2c0695212f3a961542dc9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7636C76B_F264_44A8_B5FB_DAF40CA9AC9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew nothing about having an honest, face-to-face discussion with someone about the things "
"we were thinking and feeling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사람과 정면으로 마주하며, ⟪k:1⟫서로의 감정과 ⟪k:2⟫속내를 터놓는 방법을 ⟪k:3⟫모르겠다."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4CA04C0A_498A_4B14_8295_73157439C193
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1847389bd242269c9e344a45ac678e077d1dcb59fd1c81196a640c1e38ac411
#. default-sha256: d53112e002d669550ec075494dd6e5cfcebe0078968fe476f1ee56020ce42e3a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4CA04C0A_498A_4B14_8295_73157439C193"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that didn’t change anything..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래도……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4CB3629A_C22C_48AF_B79D_4760DD361590
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87d3ae9bf9c4e361cddadaf0da9cb7fe8e2d01851db4851143a89b57f7c1e128
#. default-sha256: a67a53565169ee742400e8954486992ec897b7aae6acf6feee32a52191a655df
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4CB3629A_C22C_48AF_B79D_4760DD361590"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had to do it,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫물어봐야만 한다……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D831D3C4_8153_499F_8E4E_3289F4DFA12D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65ff09a02919630783adce686e0e446427eefc5fffd8ccd20865bfa92bcb0aac
#. default-sha256: 00628d87582bcd9886ba9986ef1beca126c0d8542054a098318796ed9e175b14
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D831D3C4_8153_499F_8E4E_3289F4DFA12D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫even if down that road lay truths I would be happier not seeing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 안에 ⟪k:1⟫내가 알기도 싫은 진실이 있더라도――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_11AD9665_548E_4721_9E8C_08EE36F08894
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16af868f2764357b6b6ddaf520c4f427fdcd229d61a242c4410a5be48c430d16
