msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario5:scenario5_3E162B84_873A_4674_91CC_E3B88D707B3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3e8edf9199733f245a3a6e8341ad10e3a1b1cee521c6d80f61c3fb17041c1f1
#. default-sha256: 74bbab82c4806eb137e3c023a17b828ff1033927cd7135ec157284083abcede6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3E162B84_873A_4674_91CC_E3B88D707B3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Could you please tell me... ⟪k:3⟫what you did at—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫no, what was done "
"to you at my family’s home,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫말해…… 주겠습니까. ⟪k:3⟫당신이 친가에서 한 것―― 아니, ⟪k:4⟫당한 것이 맞는 표현인"
"가……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C3B4E45_04D7_436C_93E2_3859E3D15729
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6234af10bfcf9b11625c355da3d0c896bef65634ae7a6af066980d265274f4d0
#. default-sha256: a4e65b55fdc74de2e327d2b273e1bfc0a2861a748602f6ba36ffcb4a40b3704d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C3B4E45_04D7_436C_93E2_3859E3D15729"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫how you ended up coming to this mansion,⟪k:1⟫and what happened after you left?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고…… 왜 제게 와야 했는지. ⟪k:1⟫이 저택에서 나온 후로 무슨 일이 있었는지……."

#: scenario5:scenario5_9DE87E9A_C5CB_4993_AD68_3A37ED68FDA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df85cf396c3b3eb21487dbc56ddc5230219459a2ea3fc6286686ca980effa6b1
#. default-sha256: fbae73c136b053ec0a63e3e13e988a026de33c73b95226cc135e1e160847e5c3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9DE87E9A_C5CB_4993_AD68_3A37ED68FDA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I would like to know everything, from start to finish."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫모든 걸…… ⟪k:1⟫차근차근."

#: scenario5:scenario5_306526DD_A850_4383_BF7C_F5A824839349
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
