#: scenario5:scenario5_1B7D3A1B_862A_42BB_8653_C56AD08FB427
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7eb1faa9a0fb5f9c221b703c4484e3ff1d66288d1998957124e1921132073cfb
