msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Will you... ⟪k:2⟫believe what I tell you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫당신은…… 믿어 주실 건가요?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_338D8B43_1D1B_41D8_856B_58F0E12E3238
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
