#: scenario5:scenario5_22848201_EC36_45E5_986B_B9A9D1A7BF9A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 109b853f665ac0b2d14af9f3230bf52247ff5c594ddccc751b3f76576c588271
