msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You never so much... ⟪k:2⟫as gave me the time of day before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫여태까지…… ⟪k:2⟫말도 안 들었으면서?"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E584FF28_B9B3_445B_98B1_EEEF908B5811
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cfd204554636f6b0152bbb6c519b2a394c457843abeba0e5709fb3071c50673
