msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_ACAEB485_D2A2_4965_9E2A_4A21437C5968"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When she realized I couldn’t go out into the sun,⟪k:2⟫my mother started thinking I was "
"possessed by a demon,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫햇살을 못 쬐는 인간…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫어머니는 갈수록 ⟪k:4⟫본인이 악마를 낳았단 착각에 빠져――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1186B9F0_614C_4098_B2B0_8C3ECD2FEB10
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9da3d05acbe88add7eac25812ee73ff8b4d36109efcbac7c213e6fe6e33b0b70
