msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫so she banished me to this mansion until my curse was broken.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That was ten "
"years ago."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫제 저주가 풀릴 때까지 ⟪k:2⟫이 외진 저택에 유폐하기로 했습니다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……그게 10년 전 "
"일입니다."

