msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The family’s reputation was at stake too.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫If other noble houses realized they "
"were giving refuge to an unholy creature,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫귀족 간의 문제가 있습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫만약 제 존재가 ⟪k:4⟫사악한 것으로 널리 알려지면――"

