"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You saw how the villagers reacted.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫They called me a demon when they saw me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫실제로…… 마을 사람들의 반응을 보지 않았습니까.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫제 모습을 보고 ⟪k:4⟫악마라 소리"
