#: scenario5:scenario5_E7D1F981_A25F_4D9B_A6CF_4EF1F0EEAE18
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3658d853b22936e2091eebbe67225757e701311c3a3e5dd5297df7ae7b684334
